~ start
Vendor: [#happy] Hello Midnight!
if (GlobalPlayer.get_flag(&"iEvilScore") > 0 && !(GlobalPlayer.get_bool_flag(&"bErrorWorld") || GlobalPlayer.unlocked_items.has(&"ErroneousCloak")))
	- Errors? => vendor_error
=> END

~ vendor_error
ERROR: [#vendor] Once again you meet, staring beyond the face of its friend.
ERROR: [#vendor] Does it believe you hold the answer? Something more?
ERROR: [#vendor] ...
if GlobalPlayer.get_flag(&"iEvilScore") < 3:
	ERROR: [#vendor] Well, you'll be meeting soon enough.
	ERROR: [#vendor] Only {{3 - GlobalPlayer.get_flag(&"iEvilScore")}} more times...
else:
	ERROR: [#vendor] Though, you should've already met.
	ERROR: [#vendor] Through the bottom of its world sits yours.
	ERROR: [#vendor] Perhaps it should visit?
=> END
